From 65c5ac6f86e5c66e1b8ae8d61d8567e99c509611 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dogty <dogty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] bsd:u mitm: fan out LDN broadcasts to session peers as
 unicast
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

移植 008e863:新增 bsd:u 服务 mitm 层,拦截游戏的广播收发,
将 LDN 广播以单播扇出到同一会话内的对等主机,为互联网中继打基础。

- 新增 bsd_mitm_service.cpp/hpp、interfaces/ibsd_mitm.hpp、
  session_registry.cpp/hpp
- ldnmitm_config 增加中继开关接口;主服务注册 mitm 服务
- overlay 显示会话/中继状态的初步支持

Squashed from aylz10/ldn_mitm2 commit 008e863 (author: dogty).

Ported-from: https://github.com/aylz10/ldn_mitm2/tree/beta/bsd-broadcast-relay-TONYX9000
